    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 33,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and compassionate veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently highlight the warmth and dedication of the veterinary doctors, technicians, and front desk personnel. Reviewers regularly mention Dr. Pham, Dr. Peralta, and Dr. Melcher for their patience during routine exams and medical emergencies. While one visitor felt the practice felt commercial, the vast majority describe a supportive team that treats pets like family."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 18,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients often praise the clinic for gentle, reassuring handling of both cats and dogs. Several owners note that staff members take a calm approach with nervous rescues and older animals, helping pets feel relaxed during vaccinations and blood draws. Only an isolated review raised concerns about animal care, while nearly all report kind and patient treatment."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear explanations and treatment guidance"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Visitors appreciate the time doctors and assistants take to discuss diagnoses and answer questions thoroughly. Reviewers note that clinicians explain test results in plain language, present clear care options without rushed decisions, and avoid pressure toward unwanted services. Clients consistently report feeling informed and comfortable with their pets' medical plans."
      }
    }
  ],
